with novel cycling designs. Institutionalisation explored how transport institutions form constraints. Institutionalisation analysed in detail the power held by various stakeholders within reflexive governance. Discourses uncovered certain implicit ‘mindsets’ that can help explain the decisions made and the ‘limits of the possible’.
